{"id": "q0130", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2173799612, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Simplify $\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2+\\sqrt{3}}$. Your solution can be converted to the form $A(1+\\sqrt{B})-(\\sqrt{C}+\\sqrt{D})$, where $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ are positive integers. What is $A+B+C+D$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0130.wav", "input_sha256": "9481880189fdb3cb8e185387777b47db300a5abb72179d4d9d03169002856cf2", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.8513, "act": 0.9956, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The fraction is likely: \\[ \\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\] Rationalize the denominator: \\[ \\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-2} = \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{-1} = \\sqrt{2}-1 \\] So the simplified form is: \\[ \\boxed{\\sqrt{2}-1} \\] Final answer: \\(\\sqrt{2}-1\\)", "expert_answer": "The fraction is likely:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}}\n\\]\n\nRationalize the denominator:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-\\sqrt{2}}\n=\n\\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-2}\n=\n\\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{-1}\n=\n\\sqrt{2}-1\n\\]\n\nSo the simplified form is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\sqrt{2}-1}\n\\]\n\nFinal answer: **\\(\\sqrt{2}-1\\)**", "transcript": "Simplify the fraction 1 plus square root 2. Your solution can be converted to the form a plus square root b, in demanded doll, where a, b, c dollars, and d dollar are positive integers. What is plus d? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.2, "expert_s": 9.52, "expert_input_samples": 222000, "expert_input_s": 13.87