{"id": "q0513", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 765925208, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "写一个标题给以下新闻报道。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0513.wav", "input_sha256": "61be53095246de8d6794cdf67b1c2eab28d418c6f0b55680b6d12f37a915e7e0", "input_samples": 43000, "input_s": 2.688, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6103, "act": 0.9676, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，你想让我写一个标题。但是你没有告诉我新闻报道的内容是什么。所以我不知道该用什么样的词汇或者风格来创作它。如果你能提供一些新闻的具体信息，比如说主题、人物或者事件等，那么我就能更好地帮助你了。因为现在这个情况有点像让你编造一个故事一样。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 27, "feed_lag_max_ms": 47, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 64, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0513_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "0e7bf5503672591625ee81b27ca1edcc37d4d348e3d0dc97b63cf8b1dcafd5b0", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 27.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.084, 1.154, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.088, 2.16, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.688, 2.768, 2.829, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.688, 3.761, 4.251, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.688, 4.756, 5.382, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.688, 5.761, 6.435, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.688, 6.759, 7.348, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.688, 7.763, 8.367, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.688, 8.758, 9.389, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.688, 9.759, 10.411, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.688, 10.761, 11.432, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.688, 11.759, 12.363, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.688, 12.767, 13.434, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.688, 13.76, 14.477, 0, 24